  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Burundi-DRC Joint Response (WASH &amp; Protection services)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stichting Vluchteling/IRC, and local partners UiA (DRC) and FS (Burundi) lead an integrated WASH &amp; Protection intervention, targeting 29.011 people in Uvira (14.506 Kalundu, 14.505 Kasenga, DRC) and 19.386 people in Bujumbura (Kansega &amp; Cishemere, Burundi). Given the fluidity of transit sites, activities may be redirected in agreement with the ACJR.</narrative>
  </description>
